      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-04-11T00:31:37.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Really, this should have a similar effect to Demoralization.  The fowl not coming back a second time with to Demoralization would still apply to the fowl not coming back a second time with Hairtrigger Reflexes.</p>\n<p>Basically, the element present preventing the first case is also existant to prevent the second.</p>",
