      "created_at": "2012-04-11T03:21:06.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I agree with TheJayMann.  Despite how the card is actually written, the previous clarification regarding the Demoralization infinite loop seems to indicate that the intent is “Remove all Fowl from the Trash.  Put all the removed Fowl into play.” or something similar to avoid just such a situation.</p>",
