      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/9fc29f/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-04-21T06:01:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>A related question.</p>\n<p>How does Hair Trigger Reflex interact with normal Fowl cards during the villain Play a Card phase?</p>\n<p>For example, a Fowl card enters play. Going by order of cards rule, HTR was in play before the Fowl card, so it triggers first, dealing 1 dmg to that Fowl card. Fowl card gets destroyed. That Fowl card never triggered to play another villain card. Correct?</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:01:06.377Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
