      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/d9b06d/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-04-21T16:31:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I believe Hairtrigger Reflexes is intended to react with Darken the Sky the same way Demoralize does. The way I see it, you completely resolve Darken the Sky first then you go through the stacked queue of instances for Hairtrigger Reflexes. Alternatively, the damage could be placed on the birds as the come into play but the actual “place defeated villain card in discard pile” phase doesn’t resolve until after Darken the Sky has finished.</p>",
